  "body": "* 4 bedrooms | 2 bathrooms | 1 garage\r\n* 166m² floor area | 205m² land area\r\n* Brand-new contemporary home with a clean, modern interior\r\n* Split-level design with open-plan family living and a separate upper-level living room\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, dining and family area with easy flow to the outdoor deck\r\n* Modern kitchen with warm timber cabinetry, stone-look surfaces and integrated appliances\r\n* Separate living room positioned above the main family living area\r\n* Dedicated study space adjoining the living room\r\n* Generous windows bringing natural light and elevated outlooks into the home\r\n* Master ensuite plus a main bathroom with a freestanding bath\r\n* Single internal-access garage with additional off-street parking\r\n* Well positioned in Silverdale, close to local amenities, schools, transport links and motorway connections\r\n\r\nBrand new and beautifully finished, 31 Tack Road offers a contemporary approach to family living, with a thoughtfully designed split-level layout that creates both connection and separation between its living spaces.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the kitchen, dining and family area come together in a bright open-plan setting. The modern kitchen features warm timber cabinetry, stone-look surfaces and integrated appliances, while generous windows bring natural light into the space. Sliding doors connect the family area directly with the outdoor deck, creating an easy flow between indoor and outdoor living.\r\n\r\nPositioned above the main family living area, the separate living room creates a distinct zone for relaxing, entertaining or enjoying some separation from the everyday activity below. A dedicated study space sits alongside the living room, offering a practical spot for working from home, studying or creating a personal workspace.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, four bedrooms are complemented by two contemporary bathrooms. The master bedroom features its own ensuite, while the separate main bathroom includes a freestanding bath and modern finishes. Generous windows throughout the upper level make the most of the home's elevated position, bringing natural light and outlooks across the surrounding Silverdale area.\r\n\r\nWith 166m² of floor area, the home offers a well-balanced layout with multiple spaces to suit different moments of the day. From the connected kitchen, dining and family zone to the separate living room and adjoining study, the design provides useful flexibility while maintaining a natural sense of flow.\r\n\r\nA single internal-access garage and additional off-street parking add everyday convenience, while the 205m² section provides an easy-care outdoor setting.\r\n\r\nPositioned in a growing and well-connected part of Silverdale, the home is within easy reach of local shops, dining, schools, transport links and motorway connections, making day-to-day living and commuting straightforward.\r\n\r\nBrand new, thoughtfully designed and ready to make your own, 31 Tack Road brings a fresh, flexible approach to modern Silverdale living.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes. Learn more at vinsonamyandco.nz.",
